<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro is for rod pvp for servers such as BlocksMC or PG, vallen etc. rod has to be on key 3
the way it works is when you press it will switch to ur sword then back to 3 and immediately throw a rod so you dont have to use right click at all. bind the macro to ur rod key or to ur right click if you think you can get used to it.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 30 1
Delay 60 ms
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyDown 32 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 15 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 10 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 10 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Minecraft</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>